# Facebook ad images

Before posting any Facebook creative, open the finished image and confirm it. Details: `backend/wrrapd-api-repo/WrrapdServer/docs/FACEBOOK-AD-IMAGES.md`.

- The role logo is small, top-left, and the whole W is visible, including both arms.
- Use `wordpress/icons/WrapStar.png`, `JoyRider.png`, or `WrapRider.png`. The black wordmark in those files is recolored cream before it sits on navy. Black type on `#0c0638` does not show.
- Role names are written in double quotes: "WrapStar", "JoyRider", "WrapRider".
- Each role shows a different person.
- No city names and no dollar amounts.
